Template: tacacsrs-bash-plugin/enable-bash-plugin
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Register tacacsrs-bash-plugin in /etc/bash_plugins.conf?
 If enabled, the package adds a managed plugin entry for
 /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/security/tacacsrs_bash_plugin.so to
 /etc/bash_plugins.conf.
 .
 Disable this to leave the existing bash plugin configuration untouched. You
 can change this later with dpkg-reconfigure tacacsrs-bash-plugin.